          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dt 32:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "My 25:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakajana ba-Israyeli bali mbuli masaansa munkanda, ndakabona bamauso mbuli inkuyu zitalika kubizwa. Pele nibakasika ku-Baala-Peori, bakalyaabila cifwisya bweeme, bakaba cisesemyo mbubonya mbuli ciyandwi cabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulemu bwa-Efraimu bulaya buuluka mbuli muyuni. Taakwe uuzyala, taakwe uuli ada, taakwe uumita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dt 31:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekuba kuti balela bana, njoobafwidya boonse buyo, Maawe kulimbabo ciindi ncenti pambukane abo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana ba-Efraimu bayoosaalwa. Efraimu ulaabila sikujaya bana bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.23.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 23:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubapa, O Jehova, ulabapa nzi? Kobapa ida lyakusowa ankolo zitanyonkwi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bubi bwabo boonse bulalibonya ku-Giligala; nkukonya oko nkundakabasulide. Nkaambo kakubija kwamilimo yabo njoobatanda kuzwa muŋanda yangu. Nsikooyoobayanda limbi. Bapati babo boonse mbasicinguni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba-Efraimu balipide, miyanda yabo iliyumide, tabaciti micelo. Nekuba kuti bazyala, njoonyonyoona bayandwi bamada aabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bam 17:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leza wangu ulabasoowa nkaambo kakutaswiilila kwabo, nkabela bayooba basimutuntuli akati kabamasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
